    vs package.json 3.1142.0, +5 more) — the Docker deploy path was DOA since
    merge 26e6210. npm install --package-lock-only resync; npm ci --dry-run
    and a real fresh-clone npm ci verified green. 290 lines churn, purely
    lockfile.
    
